<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan seals border to check smuggling - radio.</title>
<headline>Pakistan seals border to check smuggling - radio.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan has sealed its borders to check smuggling of wheat out of the country, state radio said on Saturday.</p>
<p>It quoted Local Government and Rural Development Minister Abida Hussain as saying the borders had been closed because of shortages of flour due to smuggling of wheat from the country, which shares frontiers with Afghanistan, Iran, India and China.</p>
</text>
